State 0

    0 $accept: . Program $end

    INT   shift, and go to state 1
    STR   shift, and go to state 2
    DECL  shift, and go to state 3

    Program     go to state 4
    GDeclBlock  go to state 5
    MainBlock   go to state 6
    Type        go to state 7


